Challenge 1: Status Bars
Edit: Fixed - Here is the result - also, since I was on the project, I updated it to allow for the status windows to close during dialog. Checked the FPS, lowered wait to 4, and moved the UI to the bottom to test interaction with game message.
I basically just used what was there in the engine and went from there to make it available on the map.
1 script call for the main feature inside a common event that is called with an event on map (about 12 lines condensed to fit in the visible area of the editor so no long trails of code).
